# Binaries built from the examples, one per program (go build -o nvaa-info
# ./example/info). They all carry an nvaa- prefix: a rule that ignores a file by
# name ignores a directory of that name too, and render is a package here.
# A Windows build appends .exe to these names; the rules below catch that.
/nvaa-info
/nvaa-play
/nvaa-render
/nvaa-pse
/nvaa-host

# Compiled output from linking, cgo or plugins.
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test output, coverage and profiles.
*.test
*.out
*.prof

# Editor and OS leftovers.
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
